safix::clan_unavailable

  × could not run clan, and clan is the authority on its own store.
  │ 
  │ Nothing was transferred. safix does not read, write, encrypt or decrypt
  │ a file clan placed: every value crosses that boundary through clan's own
  │ command, in both directions, so a run without it does none of its
  │ mappings rather than some of them. A run that did some would report the
  │ rest as unchanged, which is a claim about a side it never looked at.
  │ 
  │ Install clan, or name the one to use in SAFIX_CLAN.
  ╰─▶ entity not found
